# Normalize line endings to LF everywhere -- in the repository and on checkout.
# The header used to promise CRLF on Windows checkout, which `eol=lf` does not
# do and never did. LF everywhere is what this repository actually wants: mixed
# endings cause needless diffs and break the shell-extension registration
# scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary file types — never merge / diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.lib binary
*.3mf binary
*.glb binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary

# Markdown / source — force LF (these are edited on Windows too).
*.md   text eol=lf
*.rs   text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.wgsl text eol=lf

# No linguist overrides. WGSL was relabelled as Rust here to make the language
# bar on the repository page read the way we wanted, which is exactly the kind
# of dressing this project avoids everywhere else. The shaders are WGSL.
